  "source_brief": {
    "silhouette": "A compact side-on stance with a short diamond-shaped cape and a high swept hair tuft. Two flat fanlike fantasy batons form a clear paired shape.",
    "face": "Rich brown skin, green-brown eyes and dark curls clipped at the sides. Her expression is mischievous without a villainous mask.",
    "costume": "Plum festival jacket, pale shirt, teal waist cord and sturdy close-fitting trousers. Small stitched stars appear only on one large lapel.",
    "palette": "Plum #785B83; teal #548B89; parchment #E1D4BB; dark cocoa #594838.",
    "equipment": "Paired short fanlike fantasy batons and a flat messenger pouch. Do not include lockpicking gear or realistic criminal instruction props.",
    "signature": "Diamond cape, swept hair tuft and paired broad baton ends.",
    "materials": "Smooth dyed cloth, matte leather and painted wood with a few metallic accents.",
    "back": "A single diagonal teal cord crosses the short cape. Pouch placement must not collide with quick turns.",
    "animation": "Idle rests in a sideways stance. Basics use short alternating taps. The active feints with the off-hand and makes one clear forward gesture; no disappearing body or forced camera cut.",
    "vfx": "A compact gold star above the target and a faint impact ring, then the shared stun marker. No damage packet.",
    "audio": "A quick double tap and a short bright bell accent.",
    "risk": "Fast motion can become unreadable on a small model. Preserve a brief anticipation pose and avoid motion blur as a substitute."
  },
